{"id": "caltrain-trainset-repair-and-insurance", "title": "Caltrain issued a $5.14 million repair change order after a yard collision", "seconds": 59.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.033, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "e0d805cea3062d37", "words": 169, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In February 2024, a railcar struck two cars of an electric Caltrain trainset in the San Jose yard.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.4, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "the", "collision", "cost?"], "sub": "San Jose rail yard"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.61, 0.85, 1.71, 1.89, 2.46, 2.75, 3.02, 3.35, 3.45, 3.54, 3.94, 4.49, 5.03, 5.15, 5.26, 5.49, 5.81]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Caltrain reported no injuries and 2.5 million dollars in equipment damage.", "t0": 6.52, "t1": 10.68, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "incident", "kicker": "Federal Railroad Administration", "text": "Federal incident report", "mark": "Federal incident report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 1.0, 1.18, 1.6, 1.76, 2.01, 2.26, 2.53, 2.85, 3.2, 3.3, 3.7]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Caltrain directed Stadler to replace one coach and repair the other in Utah.", "t0": 10.8, "t1": 14.57, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "monitor", "kicker": "Federal Transit Administration project management oversight contractor", "text": "Replacement and repair", "mark": "Replacement and repair"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.86, 1.3, 1.41, 1.76, 1.99, 2.36, 2.55, 2.87, 2.99, 3.21, 3.34]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The federal monitor expected the trainset back in early 2026.", "t0": 14.69, "t1": 18.37, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Early 2026 forecast"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.89, 1.36, 1.47, 2.0, 2.24, 2.37, 2.63, 2.87]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The fiscal 2024 estimate was 5.5 million dollars. Caltrain tendered the claim to its insurer.", "t0": 18.59, "t1": 25.45, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "initial", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board", "text": "FY2024 initial repair estimate", "mark": "FY2024 initial repair estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.58, 0.86, 1.37, 1.85, 2.1, 2.4, 2.66, 2.95, 3.3, 4.4, 5.01, 5.33, 5.45, 5.79, 5.92, 6.06]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Caltrain later estimated the repairs at 5.3 million dollars.", "t0": 25.57, "t1": 29.26, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5.3 million", "label": "FY2025 repair estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.66, 0.97, 1.42, 1.54, 1.95, 2.08, 2.33, 2.58, 2.85, 3.17]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Its insurer agreed to reimburse most of the cost. The deductible was 500,000 dollars.", "t0": 29.38, "t1": 35.3, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "financial", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board", "text": "Property insurance", "mark": "Property insurance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.78, 1.15, 1.27, 1.77, 2.04, 2.13, 2.24, 3.36, 3.54, 4.18, 4.45, 4.75, 5.02, 5.43]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Caltrain preserved its right to seek uncovered costs from its operating contractor.", "t0": 35.42, "t1": 39.53, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Uncovered costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 1.05, 1.21, 1.44, 1.57, 1.9, 2.39, 2.71, 2.87, 3.02, 3.5]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The agency reported issuing a 5.14 million dollar change order for the repairs.", "t0": 39.65, "t1": 44.44, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "One incident", "heading": "How the change order was funded", "source": "change", "rows": [{"icon": "contract", "label": "Stadler change order", "value": "$5.14 million"}, {"icon": "fund", "label": "Funding sources", "value": "Rail Operations and insurance reimbursement"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 1.06, 1.41, 1.49, 1.76, 2.05, 2.32, 2.58, 2.87, 3.13, 3.49, 3.76, 3.88, 3.99]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It identified rail operations and insurance reimbursement as funding sources.", "t0": 44.56, "t1": 48.78, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "change", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board", "text": "September project report", "mark": "September project report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.67, 0.93, 1.57, 1.76, 2.27, 2.93, 3.11, 3.47]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The advisory committee was still discussing the repair in November.", "t0": 48.9, "t1": 52.14, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board", "text": "November 18 committee meeting", "mark": "November 18 committee meeting"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.66, 1.03, 1.18, 1.43, 1.94, 2.05, 2.41, 2.52]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The final cash cost and the trainset’s return date remain unverified.", "t0": 52.26, "t1": 56.12, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final cost", "Return date"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.84, 1.4, 1.64, 1.74, 2.28, 2.61, 2.83, 3.15]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 56.24, "t1": 58.53, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.7, 0.91, 1.23, 1.34, 1.44, 1.7, 1.95]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Two damaged cars", "accounts": "How estimates changed"}, "look": "map", "hook": "contrast"}